<title>USA: CBOT/CME closing trends - July 21.</title>
<headline>CBOT/CME closing trends - July 21.</headline>
<text>
<p>Wheat    up  4     cts/bu    Live Cattle  dn 0.500 cts/lb</p>
<p>    Corn     dn  6 1/2 cts/bu    Feeders	dn 0.025 cts/lb</p>
